  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Hydroboration-oxidation of terminal alkenes give primary alcohols. Propene gives propanol. Propanol on oxidation with PCC gives propanal. Propanal undergo nucleophilic addition reaction with methyl magnesium bromide give 2-butanol.</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0052_96724ab511ed.png\" style=\"width: 454px; height: 276px;\" /></p>"
